@startuml
title Payment with concurrency and idempotency
actor User
participant API
participant UC
database Ledger
User -> API: record payment(idempotencyKey, version)
API -> UC: authorize + validate
UC -> Ledger: BEGIN; lock/version-check obligation
UC -> Ledger: re-read effects and remaining amount
alt valid and unique
 UC -> Ledger: insert payment + settlement effect
 UC -> Ledger: COMMIT
else duplicate
 UC -> Ledger: return original result
else overspend/conflict
 UC -> Ledger: ROLLBACK
end
API --> User: result
@enduml
